    "title": "Road reopens following motorcycle crash in Jackson Township - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Zach Mosca, Multimedia Producer Camille Sipple, Multimedia Producer ,\n11 hours ago NORTH JACKSON - A stretch of I-76 Eastbound in North Jackson has reopened to traffic following a crash Wednesday afternoon. The crash happened shortly after 11:30 a.m. on I-76 near Lake Milton and Newton Falls and involved a motorcycle and another vehicle. A sergeant with the Ohio State Highway Patrol... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
